OL,3,AJames Talarico becomes first Democrat
OL,4,Ato win Texas Senate seat since 1988
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemocrat James Talarico has won a key
OL,7,FSenate race in Texas, in what is one of
OL,8,Fthe biggest upsets for Republicans in
OL,9,Fthis year's elections.
OL,11,FTalarico's stunning victory over
OL,12,FRepublican Ken Paxton marks the first
OL,13,Ftime a Democrat has won a US Senate
OL,14,Fseat in Texas since 1988 - and has
OL,15,Fhelped solidify Democrats taking full
OL,16,Fcontrol of the US Congress in a tidal
OL,17,Fwave of wins across America.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
