OL,3,AJames Talarico becomes first Democrat
OL,4,Ato win Texas Senate seat since 1988
OL,5,
OL,6,FTalarico, a former schoolteacher, was a
OL,7,Flittle-known figure until last year. He
OL,8,Fmade the rising cost of living under
OL,9,FRepublican leadership a central theme
OL,10,Fof his run.
OL,12,FPaxton sought to portray Talarico's
OL,13,Fviews as too progressive for the state,
OL,14,Fand campaigned alongside Trump on
OL,15,Fseveral occasions.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
